1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,780
(Leonard:)Yeah, no, I got it.

2
00:00:03,661 --> 00:00:06,121
(Bernadette:)-So how's your experiment going?
-Terrific.

3
00:00:06,289 --> 00:00:10,129
(Leonard:)Getting the electron accelerator set up.
We should be ready day after tomorrow.

4
00:00:10,293 --> 00:00:13,213
(Bernadette:)-Boy, I'd love to see that.
-You're welcome to come.

5
00:00:13,379 --> 00:00:15,379
Really? That'd be great.

6
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:17,170
(Bernadette:)How exciting is that?

7
00:00:17,341 --> 00:00:19,681
(Howard:)Like Hanukkah in July.

8
00:00:20,636 --> 00:00:22,136
(Bernadette:)Do they have that?

9
00:00:24,015 --> 00:00:27,855
(Sheldon:)-No.
-Oh, you got me again.

10
00:00:28,019 --> 00:00:29,979
[BOTH CHUCKLE]

11
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:34,690
(Bernadette:)This isn't non-fat yogurt.
This is fatty-fat fat.

12
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,030
(Bernadette:)Excuse me.

13
00:00:37,195 --> 00:00:39,155
-Could you grab me another napkin?
-Sure.

14
00:00:39,322 --> 00:00:40,402
(Howard:)Thanks, honey.

15
00:00:41,741 --> 00:00:43,821
(Howard:)All right. What is your deal?

16
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,160
(Leonard:)Excuse me?

17
00:00:45,328 --> 00:00:48,868
(Howard:)Inviting my girlfriend
to come see your electron accelerator?

18
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,540
Yeah, so?

19
00:00:50,875 --> 00:00:55,335
Wow, you really are a piece of work.

20
00:00:55,505 --> 00:00:57,505
(Howard:)It's not enough
you get the prom queen...

